  "historyNote": "#3181, eff 1-22-86; ss by #4061, eff 5-29-86; ss by #5399, eff 5-21-92; ss and moved by #6750, eff 5-19-98 (from Rev 703.05); ss by #8653, eff 6-8-06; ss by #10714, eff 11-7-14; ss by #12366, eff 8-22-17; para (f) amd by #12907 , eff 10-23-19; para (a) amd by #13077, eff 7-25-20; ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
